# Titanic ML pipeline

## Data leakage

- Fit preprocessing in `fit_preprocessing_artifacts` on **train fold only**.
- Apply the same artifacts to valid/test via `apply_preprocessing_artifacts`.
- `FamilySurvivalRate` and imputation stats must not use valid labels.

## Experiments

- Add or change behavior via `configs/experiments/<name>.yaml`, not hardcoded constants.
- Load with `load_experiment_config_by_name`; respect optional `experiment.parent` merge.

## Features

- Check `docs/notes.md` before re-adding rejected ideas (global ticket freq on train+test, raw deck, etc.).
- Prefer grouped features (`Deck`, `Title`, `TicketFrequency`) over raw high-cardinality columns.

## Style

- Keep functions in existing modules (`features`, `train_functions`, `metrics`).
- Use `LOGGER` in CLI/train code, not bare `print`.
- Run `python -m pytest tests/ -q` after pipeline changes.
